        "status": "present",
        "value": "Both candidates first test every cell's rectangle XOR, then the one-counts of row 0 and column 0. rowMisplaced counts j where board[0][j] == j % 2 (disagreement with the pattern starting with 1... or equivalently the other pattern); likewise for columns. For odd n, if the count is odd it must target the other pattern, so use n - count. For even n take min(count, n - count). The answer is (rowMisplaced + colMisplaced) / 2."
      },
